// Export waits for the daily checkpoint that seals the attestation leaf (up to 24 hours after Close); the manifest references the latest checkpoint and proves both the head leaf and the attestation leaf under it. A bundle without the attestation proof fails verification. checkpoint_ref and both proofs are inside the signed input.
